WEBVTT

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.270
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:42.250
Hey, hold on, Toji!

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:44.780
Don't pull me so hard! My hand!

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:51.260
This is where Toji and Sae were kissing...

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:53.820
Oh, no... Why would he bring me here?

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:57.900
He wouldn't...

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:03.630
No!

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:09.280
"'You'd Go That Far!? Super Sae"'

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:20.370
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:25.350
l wonder if he thought that with you,
Momo-chan, he could get a kiss right away.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:32.320
lt's not true...

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:36.370
Ah, Toji!

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:38.200
This is Momo-chan's-

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:43.530
Toji!

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:46.040
H- hold on!

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.480
Toji! Toji, I say!

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:54.720
What are you in such a hurry for?
Where's Momo-chan?

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:57.050
I'm hopeless...

00:02:57.050 --> 00:03:00.990
I completely blew it. I'm hopeless.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.960
I'm sure Adachi must hate me.

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:13.700
Watch out!

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.340
The light is red, Momo-chan.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.900
I know that. I know that!

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.350
Like I said...

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.020
Maybe I should walk you home.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.020
That's okay. I can get home by myself.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:35.360
So you say, but on top of the bicycle
you just had a head-on collision with,

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.760
who is it that nearly got run over by
three cars and two motorcycles already?

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:44.630
Was it that big a shock,
having Toji approach you for a kiss?

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:50.370
I don't get it. Shouldn't you be happy
to get a kiss from the person you like?

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:54.040
But that was the same place where
Toji was kissing Sae this morning!

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.710
Well, yeah, okay...

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:59.380
I couldn't stand it. No way could I stand
to be kissed in the same place as Sae!

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:02.150
How could Toji do such a thing?

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:06.990
Forcing himself on me,
without thinking about my feelings?

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:10.360
That puts him on the same level as you,
"'Bakayasu,"' doesn't it?

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:11.790
"'Bakayasu"'

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:19.040
It's like he wasn't even Toji.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:23.670
Could it be that Toji really
only sees me on the outside, too?

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:28.350
That he'd be able to fool around
with me? That I'm a playgirl?

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.010
So what if he does?

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:34.020
Even if he does think of you as a playgirl,
as long as you like him...

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:36.690
What're important are your feelings,
right Momo-chan?

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:37.690
Even so...

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:42.360
Either way, guys all have ulterior motives
to one extent or another,

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:45.700
so if that's how you feel,
you should tell him so candidly, right?

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:49.760
And then, if he leaves you, it'll just
show you the level of man that he is.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:58.540
What're important are your feelings,
right Momo-chan?

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:03.650
lt's surprising. Even he is
capable of saying something decent.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:08.020
Was he really trying
to console me after all?

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:12.320
That stupid dog is so annoying...

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:14.260
Still, for everything else
l might have said,

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:17.330
he may have provided me
with quite a bit of relief.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.800
l mean, if Okayasu hadn't
been there earlier,

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:23.000
l wouldn't have known
what to do about my feelings...

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.270
Maybe l should start thinking
a little more highly of him.

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:29.340
Just a little.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:32.240
So what if he does? Even if he
does think of you as a playgirl,

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.680
as long as you like him...

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:37.410
That's the one thing l wouldn't want, but...

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:39.820
Toji...

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.350
Shut up!

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.690
Why!? Why!? Why!?

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:52.250
Why is Toji out in front of my house!?

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:58.370
H- how long have you been here?

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:02.640
Not long. I was just in the area, so I...

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:06.080
That's not true. You're still
wearing your uniform.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.980
You haven't been home yet, have you?

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:11.980
Sorry about what happened today.

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:16.320
I just saw you talking to Okayasu,
Adachi, and I got really upset.

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:17.790
When you're with Okayasu,

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:21.330
you seemed to laugh and enjoy yourself
more than you do with me, Adachi...

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:27.000
I thought, "'Adachi is my girlfriend, dammit!"'
and couldn't help myself.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:28.330
Sorry.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:32.200
Toji... you've been out here
until now to tell me that?

00:06:36.010 --> 00:06:38.010
Thank goodness.

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:40.680
I was worried you wouldn't
listen to me anymore.

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:44.680
l was wrong... Toji isn't going out
with me because he thinks l'm a playgirl.

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:50.380
He's mindful of my feelings and everything.
And if that's the case, then Toji and l...

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:53.490
Toji and l...

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:57.120
Aah! Listen to me! Listen to me!

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.630
Well, I should be going.

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:03.300
I'll see you off.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:05.300
That's okay. It's late and all.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:06.640
See you tomorrow.

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:08.400
Mm-mm, tomorrow.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:20.650
Toji!

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:23.690
Here. I'm sorry
I took it without asking.

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:27.320
I found it inside your wallet,
which caught me by surprise,

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:30.660
but I'm sure you just
picked it up or something, right?

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:34.000
Never mind, don't say a thing!
I believe you!

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:39.000
He's right. The only thing that's important
is my affection for Toji.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.730
Okay, bye-bye!

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.540
What is this thing?

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:02.630
Kashiwagi, good morning.
Um, isn't this yours?

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:10.300
What? Kashiwagi, why are you crying?

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:13.970
Momo-chan got mad at me.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:17.430
She found out that I kissed you, Toji.

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:23.410
What should I do? I only did it
because I was thinking of Momo-chan.

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:29.680
Don't tell me she!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:37.660
That Sae doesn't know when to quit!

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.000
Toji!

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.000
Come with me.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.660
W- what is it, Adachi?

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:46.800
Don't talk to Sae anymore!
What were you talking to Sae about?

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:48.010
Was she badmouthing me?

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:49.770
I don't know what she was spouting,

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:52.010
but don't trust a single thing
that girl says!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.210
Everything she says is a lie!

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:58.350
No matter what else she says from now on,
make sure you ignore it, okay?

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:01.620
Why would you say that?
She's your friend, right?

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:04.880
My friend? Don't joke around.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:09.960
And there's one other thing
I wanted to ask you, Toji.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:13.300
You're not seeing Sae
behind my back, right?

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:16.070
N- no way. If I'm seeing you, Adachi,

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.630
there's no way I could be
seeing Kashiwagi too, right?

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:20.640
She found out that l kissed you, Toji.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:28.650
So then, you do know, Adachi. ls that why
you're mad? Are you mad at her, Adachi?

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:31.380
W- why would you ask such a thing?

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:35.950
l knew it! Everything up to now
has been one of Sae's big lies.

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:41.660
Never mind, I'm sorry.
I shouldn't have asked.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:42.630
Okay.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:55.340
Yesterday, Toji went over to
your house, huh Momo-chan?

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:56.670
How do you know that?

00:09:56.670 --> 00:10:00.130
Because I'm the one who told him to go.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:06.020
Momo-chan, I heard you rejected
a kiss from Toji yesterday.

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:08.380
Toji told me everything.

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:10.690
That's not true!

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:14.690
Toji looked like he was shocked by
your rejection, and was feeling down,

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:18.030
so I advised him to go make up with you.

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:22.000
After all, I've got
a one-step lead on Toji,

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:25.600
--and he always seems
to do what I tell him...
--No, l can't fall for what Sae is saying.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.370
lf l blame Toji now,
l'll play right into her hands.

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:31.100
But why... why?

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:35.710
Toji's lips are sure a lot softer
than I thought they'd be, you know?

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:38.380
Move! You're in the way of my cleaning!

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:39.910
Ow!

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:54.060
How come? l just shook it a little bit...

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:54.730
Kashiwagi!

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:55.730
Are you okay?

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:57.070
Sae-chan!

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:58.430
Are you all right?

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.340
Yow!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.670
I... I...

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:05.570
What did you do, Adachi!?

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:26.060
Hey, she'll be okay, right?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.860
lt's not true... Could it be
that l'm the bad guy?

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:41.710
Kashiwagi, don't tell me
that bruise on your cheek...

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:43.710
Don't talk to Sae anymore!

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:45.910
N- never mind, it's nothing.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.400
Why that little faker!

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.670
Sae! Just a minute!

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:04.670
Adachi?

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:08.670
What's with you!? You're not
really even hurt at all, are you!?

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:11.010
You just made a big show of falling down
in front of Toji on purpose, didn't you?

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:13.010
What? Momo-chan, what's come over you?

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:15.680
You just get away from Toji!

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:16.680
Stop that, Adachi!

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:23.020
Don't let her fool you, Toji! She'll do
anything to get whatever it is she wants!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:26.360
How cruel! Momo-chan,
is that what you think of me?

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:30.360
Stop that! You're just doing this
to try to get Toji on your side again!

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:33.700
And you don't really even like Toji!

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:38.040
Why do you always have
to copy other people like this!?

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.700
When have I ever copied you!?

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:40.700
You have, haven't you!?

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:41.710
Have not!

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:42.370
Have so!

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:43.370
I have not!

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.710
Yes you have!

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.380
What are you talking about!?

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:47.930
Enough already!

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:51.050
Toji...

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:54.380
You're mad about me
kissing Kashiwagi, right?

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:57.390
In that case, you can't just
blame Kashiwagi alone for it.

00:12:57.390 --> 00:13:00.660
W- why are you protecting her?

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:05.330
Adachi, Kashiwagi is a lot more
concerned about you than you think.

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:09.670
She's a good girl, who worries about
her friends. But as for you, Adachi,

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:11.190
I've misjudged you.

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:25.020
Toji, you idiot!

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:28.690
How can you believe Sae so easily!?

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:33.450
Why won't you believe what
I tell you!? Toji, you idiot!

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:41.030
l'm going to tell him
everything l know about Sae.

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:45.560
Otherwise, l'll just be a selfish,
monopolizing, brazenly violent girl to him.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.040
Mom, do we have any stomachache medicine?

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:56.570
What? Did you eat something unhealthy?
We should have some in that drawer.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.720
Okay, okay...

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:03.650
Yes, Tojigamori residence...
Yes, one moment, please.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:07.820
Kazuya, it's a girl.
Do you know an Adachi-san?

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:08.660
Yes?

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:11.800
He doesn't sound happy!
B- but l have to get through this.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:14.660
l have to break through Sae's mind control.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:17.770
Ah, Toji? Sorry about
what happened earlier.

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:19.400
I've thought about what I've done.

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:29.010
So, you might say I'm wrong, Toji,
but Sae is always like that.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:32.080
She snatched up the bag
I had my eye on earlier,

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.680
and she's always copying me.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:37.690
So you see, when she asked me
if there was anyone that I liked,

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:44.690
I got all nervous, and quickly said that
I liked someone else, and sure enough...

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:45.700
Adachi...

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:46.700
What?

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:51.370
Sorry, but I'm not really in the mood to
listen to you run down Kashiwagi right now.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:57.040
I- it might sound like I'm running her down,
but just hear me out. I'm just...

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:00.380
I apologize for kissing Kashiwagi.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:02.780
It's no wonder why you'd
be angry at her, Adachi.

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:05.650
If I were in your shoes,
I doubt I'd let it go, either.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:06.650
Toji, you know...

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:10.650
But... but I wasn't trying
to betray you, Adachi.

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:14.560
It's not that, Toji! It's not
that I'm angry about the kiss-

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.990
well, I'd be lying if I said
I wasn't angry about it-

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:18.330
but what I'm trying to say is-

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.660
Good night.

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:21.530
Toji!? Toji!?

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:41.020
Absent today are Tojigamori
and Adachi, huh?

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:46.020
Oh, right. About Tojigamori-
his folks contacted us this morning,

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:47.890
and they said he went to
the hospital with appendicitis.

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:50.660
We're so close to the end of the term,

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:53.930
so if anyone goes to visit him,
take your notes along for him.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:16:01.300
"'Have you ever feared that a lot
of terrible things may happen..."'

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:02.310
What's this?

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.640
They said to pass it around to everyone.

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:06.310
Read it and pass it down.

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:07.640
What is this? What's going on?

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.970
Seriously? What's this for?

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:17.180
Even if l didn't get any sleep last night,
it's embarrassing to be late.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.460
W- what's going on?

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.940
l'm getting a bad feeling about this.

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:37.370
"'Daily Duty Officers: Tanaka, Haruki"'

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:42.010
Oh. l don't know whether
l should be relieved or not.

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:46.680
And so, Buddhism spread quickly
throughout the population

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:50.140
--during the Kamakura period...
--What could have happened to him?
l wonder if he caught a cold or something.

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.130
Isn't she awful?

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:07.130
W- what's going on here? What is this?

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:10.970
Excuse me.

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:12.640
Good afternoon!

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:13.980
Kashiwagi...

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:19.980
Wow, this is a surprise! Your appendix?
Are you okay? Did they operate?

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:23.650
This is from the whole class,
and these are today's notes.

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.320
Thank you.

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:30.660
When did your stomach start hurting?
You seemed completely fine yesterday.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:33.000
Since just before dinner, I guess.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:36.000
Um, Kashiwagi, are you alone?

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:40.670
Mm-hmm. I invited Momo-chan
to come with me, but...

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:42.070
I see.

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:47.340
Well, I'll be going. Take care.

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:48.350
Already?

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:52.680
I can't stay too long,
or it will offend Momo-chan.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:55.690
If there's anything you want,
I'm listening.

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:57.690
Deliver a message?

00:17:57.690 --> 00:18:00.360
I got a phone call from Adachi yesterday,

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:02.490
but my stomach was
in intense pain at the time,

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:04.960
and it was hard to listen to her talk,

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:08.630
and I have a feeling that
I hung up on her rather harshly.

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:09.970
You did?

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:12.970
Would you tell Adachi that I'm sorry?

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:15.100
Of course! I'll take care of it!

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:22.310
Aza... (bruise) azatoi... (unscrupulous)
azamuku... (deceive)

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:25.300
azayaka... (skillful)
azawarau... (sneer at)

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.920
"'Absent: Tojigamori"'
"'Daily Duty Officers: Kajiwara, Itakura"'

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:42.000
lt's okay. l just want to know
why he's staying home.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:45.660
But if he starts thinking
l'm hounding again...

00:18:48.340 --> 00:18:50.970
Here. It's a card from everyone.

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:55.870
Ow... It hurts my stomach when I laugh.

00:18:57.680 --> 00:19:00.020
Adachi didn't write anything.

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:05.290
Uh... mm-mm... I invited her
to come with me again today, too.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:06.620
Yeah...

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.290
I'm sorry...

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:11.630
Your relationship is
on the rocks because of me.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:12.960
Kashiwagi...

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:16.300
I won't come here anymore.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.970
Goodbye!

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:19.200
Kashiwagi!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:25.640
Toji, huh?

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:28.650
Mm-hmm, he's been absent
for three whole days.

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:32.980
I've asked some of Toji's close friends,
but they say they don't know where he is.

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:33.980
That's strange.

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.420
Speaking of strange,

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:37.650
there's this weird climate going on
among the class, you know?

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:41.990
It's like they're whispering about me,
and giving me the evil eye, you might say.

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:43.990
Momo-chan, are they picking on you?

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.980
No, I wouldn't say that...

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.000
Well...

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.670
Do I have to go back to that class?

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:56.340
Well, what if you came over to my room,
at least during break times?

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.340
You're most welcome.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:01.640
Get real. If I did that,
I'd end up being in your entourage-

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.690
Okayasu!

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.360
Okayasu! Are you okay, Okayasu!?

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:16.360
Momo-chan, that hurt...

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.700
S- sorry. My foot slipped.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:21.360
Nope, your hands were out to push me down.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:25.700
Cut it out! Even if you are a letch
and a perv beyond any hope,

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.700
I wouldn't have done that on purpose!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.710
That's not a very nice thing to say...

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.070
Here, can you stand up?

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:37.640
Are you okay?

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.720
Hey! What are you hugging me for!?

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.720
Why, because you're so soft!

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:46.060
Let me go, you letch! You pervert!

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:50.390
You know what they're going to say
if someone sees us here like this!?

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:51.880
Come on, now-

00:20:58.070 --> 00:21:01.670
Don't tell me you really
do like Adachi, do you!?

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:04.010
That girl is no good! Absolutely no good!

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:07.280
I heard she tried to steal
her best friend's boyfriend away

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:08.340
by pretending to like him!

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:11.010
Huh? And who is Momo-chan's best friend?

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:12.680
Kashiwagi Sae.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:14.020
And her best friend's boyfriend?

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:15.510
Tojigamori!

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:21.360
Adachi was hugging Okayasu?

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:25.300
I'm so sorry! I said
I wouldn't come back here,

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:28.700
but I thought Momo-chan had gone too far,

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:32.040
while you're in here like this, Toji!

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:35.710
Adachi... and Okayasu...

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:37.260
You're kidding, right?

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:40.380
Momo-chan!

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:42.380
Stay away!

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:47.050
I don't have anything to say to you!
Leave me alone!

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:49.250
Toji is in the hospital with appendicitis!

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.060
You're kidding!

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:54.720
It sounds like Sae-chan did
some maneuvering behind the scenes.

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:57.490
Word is that she asked everyone to
please keep it a secret from Momo-chan

00:21:57.490 --> 00:21:58.730
that Toji was in the hospital,

00:21:58.730 --> 00:22:01.200
because she wanted to at least tend to him

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:05.070
while he was there
without you interfering with her.

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.010
Why would she do that?

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.680
In short, the story is that
Toji is Sae-chan's boyfriend,

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:15.610
and that you were trying to
steal him away from her, Momo-chan.

00:22:18.010 --> 00:22:20.020
Why, that little!

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:23.510
M- Momo-chan... calm down...

00:22:24.350 --> 00:22:27.320
That rotten Sae!!

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:43.200
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:52.880
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.880 --> 00:22:55.880
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.880 --> 00:23:02.480
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:08.820
Where can we go

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:18.500
where we can all be

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:21.170
under the same sky?

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:29.510
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:36.190
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:42.520
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:49.530
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:57.200
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.140 --> 00:24:03.010
You're the one
who's got it all wrong, Toji!

00:24:03.010 --> 00:24:05.150
Why won't you believe
what l'm telling you,

00:24:05.150 --> 00:24:07.280
yet you will believe what Sae says!?

00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:11.490
Toji... Toji...
l'm breaking up with you!

00:24:11.490 --> 00:24:15.150
Next time on {each Girl,
"'A {ure and {roper Break-up Declaration"'
